<title>USA: Xoma delays kidney transplant drug study.</title>
<headline>Xoma delays kidney transplant drug study.</headline>
<dateline>BERKELEY, Calif. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xoma Corp said Thursday it has temporarily withdrawn its investigational new drug application of hu11 24 for kidney transplant patients so it could reconsider appropriate dosing levels.</p>
</text>
